# Normalize line endings: store text files as LF in the repo and check them out as LF on every
# platform (including Windows with core.autocrlf=true). Biome's formatter expects LF, so CRLF
# checkouts made the Windows CI job fail at the lint step.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings or attempt textual diffs.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.tiff binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.dmg  binary
*.exe  binary
